{"4519280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deep in the Fields", "steam_appid": 4519280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Rural Argentine Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the Fields is a first-person atmospheric horror game set on a remote Argentine farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive at an isolated rural ranch in search of work, but as you explore the property you begin to uncover unsettling secrets hidden deep within the fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned buildings, barns, and underground spaces while piecing together clues about what happened on the property. Investigate strange locations and survive the growing sense that something is watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• First-person exploration in a rural Argentine setting<br>• Atmospheric horror and environmental storytelling<br>• Puzzle-solving and investigation mechanics<br>• Immersive environments inspired by countryside farms<br>• A mysterious narrative revealed through exploration</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Rural Argentine Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the Fields is a first-person atmospheric horror game set on a remote Argentine farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive at an isolated rural ranch in search of work, but as you explore the property you begin to uncover unsettling secrets hidden deep within the fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned buildings, barns, and underground spaces while piecing together clues about what happened on the property. Investigate strange locations and survive the growing sense that something is watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• First-person exploration in a rural Argentine setting<br>• Atmospheric horror and environmental storytelling<br>• Puzzle